'''Relentless Gladios''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 8.10 Update|Version 8.10]]. He can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]] improves health and grants 100% chance to Knockback and Slow [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]].

