==Trivia==
*Since several of the other [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Dragon Emperors]] appear to have been named after video games, Gladios' name may be a reference to ''[[wikipedia:Gradius|Gradius]]'', which is spelled and pronounced almost the same in Japanese:
**グラディウス ''Guradiusu'' (''Gradius'') → グラディオス ''Guradiosu'' (Gladios)
*Visually, Gladios and his evolutions may be based on the [[wikipedia:Eupatorus gracilicornis|five-horned rhinoceros beetle]] (''Eupatorus gracilicornis'').
*Relentless Gladios' Japanese title, Kakuryū (角龍, "Horned Dragon"), may be a pun on [[wikipedia:Ryūkaku-ji|Ryūkaku-ji]] (龍角寺), one of the oldest Buddhist temples in eastern Japan.
*Relentless Gladios is the second Dragon Emperor to have a "title" in Normal Form, with the first being [[High Lord Babel (Legend Rare Cat)|High Lord Babel]].

